profile.comment=POTATO: fastest - sky, lighting colour, tonemap, flat clouds. No shadows, reflections or post. REGULAR: everything, moderate quality, reflections and godrays at half resolution. INSANE: everything at max.

screen.SKY=Sky & Clouds
screen.LIGHTING=Lighting & Shadows
screen.WATER=Water
screen.ATMOSPHERE=Atmosphere
screen.POST=Post Processing
screen.PBR=Generated Materials

option.FULLBRIGHT=Fullbright
option.FULLBRIGHT.comment=Lifts the darkest light so caves are visible without torches. The colours stay graded, never flat grey.
option.RENDER_SCALE=Render Scale
option.RENDER_SCALE.comment=Resolution of the expensive passes: 3D clouds, water reflections and godrays. Lower = faster. The world itself stays sharp.
value.RENDER_SCALE.50=0.50x
value.RENDER_SCALE.60=0.60x
value.RENDER_SCALE.70=0.70x
value.RENDER_SCALE.75=0.75x
value.RENDER_SCALE.80=0.80x
value.RENDER_SCALE.90=0.90x
value.RENDER_SCALE.100=1.00x
option.HALF_RES_FX=Half-Res Reflections & Godrays
option.HALF_RES_FX.comment=Runs water reflections and godrays at half of the Render Scale. On in REGULAR, off in INSANE.
option.EXPOSURE=Brightness
option.EXPOSURE.comment=Overall image brightness.
suffix.EXPOSURE=%
option.SATURATION=Saturation
option.SATURATION.comment=Colour saturation after tonemapping.
suffix.SATURATION=%

option.STARS=Stars
option.STARS.comment=Stars at night. They turn with the sky.
option.CLOUDS=Clouds
option.CLOUDS.comment=Clouds with vanilla shapes. Off removes clouds completely.
option.CLOUDS_3D=3D Clouds
option.CLOUDS_3D.comment=Thick blocky clouds with lit tops, shaded sides and tinted undersides. Off = a cheap flat vanilla-style layer.
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS=Cloud Shadows
option.CLOUD_SHADOWS.comment=Clouds cast soft shadows that drift across the ground.
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS=Cloud Thickness
option.CLOUD_THICKNESS.comment=Height of the blocky clouds in blocks. Vanilla clouds are 4.
suffix.CLOUD_THICKNESS= blocks
option.CLOUD_STEPS=Cloud Distance Quality
option.CLOUD_STEPS.comment=How many cloud cells each pixel traces. More keeps low clouds near the horizon solid.

option.SHADOWS=Shadows
option.SHADOWS.comment=The sun and moon cast real, soft shadows.
option.shadowMapResolution=Shadow Resolution
option.shadowMapResolution.comment=Sharpness of shadows. Higher costs memory and speed.
option.shadowDistance=Shadow Distance
option.shadowDistance.comment=How far away shadows are drawn, in blocks.
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES=Shadow Smoothness
option.SHADOW_SAMPLES.comment=Samples used to soften shadow edges. More = smoother, slower.
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=Shadow Softness
option.SHADOW_SOFTNESS.comment=Width of the soft edge of shadows.
suffix.SHADOW_SOFTNESS=%
option.COLORED_SHADOWS=Coloured Shadows
option.COLORED_SHADOWS.comment=Stained glass and water tint the sunlight that passes through them.
option.COLORED_LIGHT=Coloured Block Light
option.COLORED_LIGHT.comment=Light near glowing blocks takes their colour: soul fire blue, lava orange, redstone red. Based on what is on screen.
option.FOLIAGE_SSS=Leaf Translucency
option.FOLIAGE_SSS.comment=Sunlight shines through leaves and plants.
option.sunPathRotation=Sun Path Angle
option.sunPathRotation.comment=Tilts the path of the sun and moon so noon shadows are not straight down.

option.WATER_WAVES=Water Waves
option.WATER_WAVES.comment=Gentle animated waves on water.
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS=Water Reflections
option.WATER_REFLECTIONS.comment=Water reflects the world on screen. When off, water still reflects the sky and clouds.
option.WATER_REFRACTION=Water Refraction
option.WATER_REFRACTION.comment=The underwater world bends through the water surface.
option.SSR_STEPS=Reflection Quality
option.SSR_STEPS.comment=Steps each reflection ray takes. More = more accurate reflections, slower.
option.UNDERWATER_FOG=Underwater Fog
option.UNDERWATER_FOG.comment=Tinted fog while you are under water.

option.FOG=Distance Fog
option.FOG.comment=Distant terrain fades into the sky colour. Thicker in rain.
option.FOG_DENSITY=Fog Amount
suffix.FOG_DENSITY=%
option.GODRAYS=Godrays
option.GODRAYS.comment=Subtle shafts of light from the sun and moon. Needs Shadows.
option.GODRAY_STRENGTH=Godray Strength
suffix.GODRAY_STRENGTH=%
option.GODRAY_SAMPLES=Godray Quality
option.GODRAY_SAMPLES.comment=Samples per pixel for godrays. More = smoother, slower.
option.WET_LOOK=Rain Wetness
option.WET_LOOK.comment=Surfaces darken and turn glossy in the rain.

option.BLOOM=Bloom
option.BLOOM.comment=Soft glow around bright things like the sun, lava and torches.
option.BLOOM_STRENGTH=Bloom Strength
suffix.BLOOM_STRENGTH=%
option.TAA=Anti-Aliasing (TAA)
option.TAA.comment=Smooths jagged edges and shimmering over time.
option.SHARPEN=Sharpening
option.SHARPEN.comment=Light sharpening to keep textures crisp after anti-aliasing.
option.SHARPEN_AMOUNT=Sharpening Amount
suffix.SHARPEN_AMOUNT=%

option.GENERATED_NORMALS=Generated Normals
option.GENERATED_NORMALS.comment=Adds bumpy surface detail worked out from the vanilla textures. No resource pack needed.
option.NORMAL_STRENGTH=Normal Strength
suffix.NORMAL_STRENGTH=%
option.GENERATED_SPECULAR=Generated Specular
option.GENERATED_SPECULAR.comment=Glossy highlights on smooth and metal blocks, worked out from the vanilla textures.
